# Positive coefficient Wronskians for all deep-atom transfer gaps

The exact ten polynomial coefficient rows have positive values and
positive pair-relative Wronskians on the shifted half-line. Keeping
this algebraic certificate independent of source imports lets each
sign proof use the default Lean resource limits. The source identities
and infinite-sum transport are supplied by a separate leaf.
-/

